### GET ALL STUDENTS
GET http://localhost:3000/students

###

### GET SINGLE STUDENT
GET http://localhost:3000/students/PASTE_STUDENT_ID_HERE

###

### CREATE STUDENT
POST http://localhost:3000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "David",
  "lastName": "Miller",
  "email": "david.miller@email.com",
  "age": 26,
  "course": "Artificial Intelligence",
  "gpa": 3.8,
  "enrollmentDate": "2026-05-26"
}

###

### UPDATE STUDENT
PUT http://localhost:3000/students/PASTE_STUDENT_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "David",
  "lastName": "Miller",
  "email": "updateddavid@email.com",
  "age": 27,
  "course": "Machine Learning",
  "gpa": 4.0,
  "enrollmentDate": "2026-05-26"
}

###

### DELETE STUDENT
DELETE http://localhost:3000/students/PASTE_STUDENT_ID_HERE

